Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:10.07,Base,,0,0,0,,Every day, we throw away countless things at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:15.52,Base,,0,0,0,,But where do they really go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:27.07,Base,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at the reality of waste and recycling\Nat Shinjeong Middle School.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.77,0:00:37.02,Base,,0,0,0,,Q.  Do students recycle well at our school?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:49.76,Base,,0,0,0,,A.  Most people do a good job, but some plastic bottles\Nare not rinsed or still have their labels on.\NI think we can do a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:01:00.70,Base,,0,0,0,,Some students throw away plastic bottles\Nwithout rinsing them or removing their labels.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:12.05,Base,,0,0,0,,Incorrect sorting means that recyclable materials\Nend up in landfills.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.08,0:01:20.50,Base,,0,0,0,,But this problem is not limited to our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.95,0:01:26.94,Base,,0,0,0,,Waste is a global problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.83,0:01:36.20,Base,,0,0,0,,What we do at school can make a difference\Nbeyond our community.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.77,0:01:44.22,Base,,0,0,0,,①  Empty completely
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.24,0:01:50.00,Base,,0,0,0,,②  Rinse with water
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.66,Base,,0,0,0,,③  Remove the label
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:02.87,Base,,0,0,0,,④  Sort it into the correct recycling bin
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.75,0:02:12.40,Base,,0,0,0,,As global citizens, change begins with our small habits.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.39,0:02:21.75,Base,,0,0,0,,Empty, rinse, remove, and sort!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.55,0:02:32.42,Base,,0,0,0,,Let's protect our Earth together,\Nstarting from our Shinjeong Middle School.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.34,0:02:42.03,Base,,0,0,0,,SMALL ACTIONS.  BIG CHANGES.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.06,0:02:49.60,Base,,0,0,0,,START WITH SHINJEONG MIDDLE SCHOOL
